<title>ANTIGUA AND BARBUDA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT SRI LANKA BY 6 WICKETS IN FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT SRI LANKA BY 6 WICKETS IN FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat Sri Lanka by six wickets on the third day of the first test on Sunday to take a 1-0 lead in the two-match series.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 223 and 152, West Indies 189 and 189-4.</p>
</text>
